    "practice": {
      "description": "Дан HTML:\n```html\n<div id=\"main\">\n  <p class=\"note\">Один</p>\n  <p class=\"note\">Два</p>\n</div>\n```\n\nВ `<style>`:\n1. `#main` — `background: lightgray;`\n2. `.note` — `color: green;`\n3. `#main p` — `font-size: 20px;`\n\nВидимый текст: `Один Два`",
      "starter": "<div id=\"main\">\n  <p class=\"note\">Один</p>\n  <p class=\"note\">Два</p>\n</div>\n<style>\n  /* TODO */\n</style>\n",
      "expected": "Один Два",
      "must_contain": ["#main", ".note", "#main p", "background:", "color:", "font-size:"]
    }
  },
